    "amazonUrl": "",
    "pros": [
      "Low price for a name-brand ceiling paint",
      "Flat finish hides minor flaws",
      "Widely available at Home Depot",
      "Low odor and easy cleanup",
      "Can be tinted to pale ceiling shades"
